1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Three teammates. One Session. One agent.
The brief: turn “works on my machine” into shared evidence.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Select the part you mean. Then write in chat.
Maya · Designer: “Lead with shared evidence, not blame.”

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Everyone sees who is about to contribute.
Three native clients. The same conversation.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Engineering narrows the first release.
Eli: runtime versions and the failing command. Automatic repair can wait.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
QA brings an edge case into the same thread.
Sam selects a region: “What happens offline?”

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The agent turns feedback into a visible Plan.
Two items addressed. One deferred. Nobody’s feedback disappears.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Deferred comes with a reason.
The agent explains the boundary and links back to Sam’s message.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Follow a decision back to its source.
Maya’s exact contribution stays attached to the agent’s decision.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Open the saved result. Keep working together.
The same Plan connects the conversation to the work it produced.
